2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
plugin "beancount.plugins.auto_accounts"

2020-01-01 * "uses two accounts never opened"
  Equity:Opening  -9 USD
  Assets:B         9 USD

; auto_accounts gives an open it inserts the place of its account among
; every account used, in account order, as its line: Assets:B is the second
; of four, so line 1, and Equity:Opening the fourth, so line 3. Among the
; opens of one date that puts Equity:Opening after the opens written on
; lines 1 and 2, and Assets:B, which shares line 1 with a written open,
; ahead of it: the inserted opens are sorted in first. (The comment is last
; to keep those line numbers.)
